      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "APOSTLE (1) is ready to put it all together fourth-up after two narrow defeats. Has proven versatile with his speed, so can do as he pleases in this small field. McMurray's claim adds to his case. WIN STAR (6) finished a tick under 2L off APOSTLE at the latest but only meets him a touch better at the weights with Thompson replacing the claimer. Suspect those two will be fighting it out. PEARL PENDANT (7) brings different form but winning form nevertheless, and gets in light with the rise in grade. Knockout chance. MAY THE FORCE (4) also gets in light with the rise in grade and is drawn to get the suck run. No reason she can't fill the drum if things go her way. SPIRIT OF TORQUE (8) is still a maiden but should be at her top now and looks best of the rest.",
